sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements BinaryPipeSendResponse]
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements BinaryPipeSend]

    Note over Product, CN: Precondition: connected, BinaryPipeConnection.Available received

    Product->>CN: BinaryPipeSend.SendData(<br>subchannel=1, data=256 bytes)

    alt Normal completion
        CN-->>Product: BinaryPipeSendResponse.SendCompleted()
    else Connection lost during send
        CN-->>Product: BinaryPipeConnection.Unavailable()
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(standby)
        Note over Product, CN: SendCompleted is not received
    end
